<h2>The scale of India's spice trade</h2>
<p>India is the world's largest spice producer, consumer and exporter, and the calendar-2024 data we've verified across several major spice lines gives a clear picture of where the value actually concentrates. This overview pulls together figures from our individual product pages into one comparison, so you can see the relative scale before drilling into any one spice.</p>

